# Immediate Rinshan Kaihou tsumo after an added kan (kakan) does NOT see the owed kan dora
# (engine.md §4.2 Kan transactions, rules.md §4.17).
# Seat 0 discards 5z -> Seat 1 calls pon:55z, discards 9m.
# Seats 2, 3, 0 tsumogiri; Seat 1 draws 4th 5z, declares kakan 5z (no robber),
# draws rinshan 7s and immediately wins by tsumo!
# Kan dora indicator (7p -> dora 8p, of which Seat 1 holds two!) is NOT flipped and NOT counted!
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 56s 88p + kakan 5555z + tsumo 7s (dora ind 1z -> 0 dora; kan dora 7p NOT active)
#   Yaku: rinshan (1) + yakuhai_haku (1) = 2 han
#   Fu: 20 base + 2 tsumo + 16 open kan (5z) = 38 -> 40 fu
#   Non-dealer 2 han 40 fu tsumo: 700 / 1300 (+2700).

[meta]
